  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reactor safety, non-proliferation, radioactive waste</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Reaktors&#xE4;kerhet, icke-spridning, radioaktivt avfall</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Among other things to support the Ukranian authority SNRIU in dealing with ageing in nuclear power plants, non-destructive testing (NDT) of components, regulations for licensing of nuclear fuel, as well as establishing software for risk evaluation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Att bl.a. st&#xF6;dja myndigheten i Ukraina att hantera &#xE5;ldring i k&#xE4;rnkraftverk, of&#xF6;rst&#xF6;rande provning (OFP) av komponenter, f&#xF6;reskrifter f&#xF6;r licensiering av k&#xE4;rnbr&#xE4;nsle, samt etablering av mjukvara f&#xF6;r riskbed&#xF6;mningar.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cooperation on reactor safety and non-proliferation within the radiation protection and emergency preparedness areas, as well as dealing with radioactive waste.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Samarbete inom reaktors&#xE4;kerhets- och icke spridningsomr&#xE5;det, inom str&#xE5;lskydds- och beredskapsomr&#xE5;det, samt hantering av radioaktivt avfall.</narrative>
  </description>
